# Day 17 — Closing Phase D: small fixes, gestures, settings editor

Phase D is finished except for the TIFF test (pan at 1600 % on the largest microscopy TIFF), which waits for the archives in test\images\tiff.

## Day 16 result

Zooming now switches to the original pixels quickly (GPU mipmaps, 1024 tiles, middle first, sharpening tile by tile). Confirmed by the user: "it is fixed".

## Changes

**(a) Zoom wheel reversed.** In zoom mode (X1 / Z) the wheel towards you zooms in, away from you zooms out. (uInputHandler)

**(b) WrapScope.** Was already there as `Folder | Tree`. MView.ini now writes `Dir`; `Folder` and `Directory` are still read. `WrapScope=Dir` with `WrapAround=1`: the last image of a folder is followed by the first image of the same folder; only the gestures and the Up / Down keys change folders. (uTypes)

**(c) Rotation around the mouse:** postponed at the user's request. Rotation around the window centre stays; the mouse point is only useful for preparing crops (Phase G).

**(d) Right-button gestures** (spec §9.2, as in Hamana):

| Gesture (right button held, move, release) | Command |
|---|---|
| left | previous folder |
| right | next folder |
| down | exit |
| up | not used yet (Hamana: parent folder) |

The movement must be at least 40 px, and the main direction at least 1.5 times the other one; a diagonal stroke does nothing. A right click without movement still opens the context menu; after a gesture it doesn't (DoContextPopup in both surfaces asks TInputHandler.SuppressContextMenu).

**(e) Settings editor.** MView started without a file or folder shows MView.ini in an editor (uIniEditor: SynEdit with ini highlighting) instead of the last session:
- The help line at the bottom explains the key under the cursor (uConfig.ConfigKeyHelp); unknown keys are marked as kept but unused.
- Buttons: View images (F5), Save (Ctrl+S), Undo changes, Exit. View images saves first, then starts the viewer with the last session. TMView is created only then, so it reads what was just saved.
- Exit with unsaved changes needs a second press (no dialogs, spec §3.1).
- Before it opens, the ini is completed with all keys MView knows (values, comments and unknown keys stay).
- It is a page control: a graphical page (mouse quadrants, Phase F) can be added next to the text.
- `[Startup] OpenLastSession` is no longer used.

Project: new unit source\config\uIniEditor.pas; the SynEdit package (ships with Lazarus) is now required (MView.lpi).

## To check

- Build: close the Lazarus tabs without saving (or File > Reload) first. Lazarus may ask about the SynEdit package the first time.
- Start without parameters (Run > Run Parameters empty): the editor appears. Move through the keys: the help line follows. View images: the last session opens in the viewer.
- Right-drag left / right: folder changes. Right-drag down: exit. Right click: menu.
- Zoom mode: wheel towards you zooms in.
- WrapScope=Dir: stays in the folder at the end of a folder.

