## Added after testing ("it already feels better than Hamana")

- **Balloon help in the settings editor:** pointing at a line shows its explanation as a hint (key on the first line, explanation below; stays 15 s). Same text as the help line, which follows the cursor.
- **Text lines as overlays:** info line, diagnostics line and mode label are now white text with a thin dark outline straight over the image, no black boxes (GPU: the text texture drawn black in 8 one-pixel offsets plus a soft shadow, then white; CPU renderer the same with TextOut). The "no image" message stays on black.
